    63	// T-181 (L08), T-185: a model that never picks the a2a skill still has to know the command exists. Claude Code (its
    64	// plugin) and Codex (the shim's -c hooks.SessionStart) both run this at session start and add additionalContext to
    65	// the session's context, so the text holds for either CLI.
    66	// T-185, T-187: one orientation for every terminal CLI: Claude and Codex get it from their session-start hook, opencode
    67	// reads the file as its instructions (terminal/bin/opencode), agy reads it as the AGENTS.md of a directory the shim adds
    68	// to its workspace (terminal/bin/agy).
    69	const orientation = readFileSync(fileURLToPath(new URL("../terminal/orientation/AGENTS.md", import.meta.url)), "utf8").trimEnd();
